WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE
Captions for "Christ Lives in Me" (Nabambanwe na Kristo), Aime Frank.
The song is sung in Kinyarwanda. These English captions describe the
music and translate the main message; they are a summary, not word-for-word lyrics.
Video length: 13:21.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Music begins]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:20.000
[Aime Frank and the worship team sing in Kinyarwanda]

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:52.000
♪ "Nabambanwe na Kristo" — I am crucified with Christ ♪

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:04.000
♪ It is no longer I who live, but Christ lives in me ♪

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:12.000
[Singers raise their hands in worship]

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:12.000
♪ The life I now live, I live by faith in the Son of God ♪

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:24.000
♪ who loved me and gave Himself for me ♪

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:42.000
[Song of thanksgiving (amashimwe) continues]

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:12.000
♪ I am crucified with Christ ♪

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:24.000
♪ Christ lives in me ♪

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:12.000
[The congregation joins in worship]

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:42.000
[Worship and thanksgiving continue]

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:12.000
♪ "Nabambanwe na Kristo" — I am crucified with Christ ♪

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:40.000
[The chorus is sung softly as the worship slows]

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:21.000
[Music ends]
